  "long_description": "## What it is\n\nThe Waaree Bi-55-545 is a 545 Wp framed dual-glass bifacial solar module from Waaree's AHNAY Series, built from 144 half-cut M10 Mono PERC bifacial cells (91 × 182 mm) laid out 12×6 || 12×6 and interconnected with multi-busbar ribbons. Instead of a polymer backsheet it uses a second sheet of 2 mm low-iron printed semi-tempered glass, so the rear face also collects light. Module efficiency at standard test conditions is 21.17%.\n\n## What it's for\n\nGrid-tied rooftop solar on houses, apartment blocks and commercial buildings, and ground-mounted captive plants where the reflected light off a light-coloured roof or hardstanding can be turned into extra output. The glass-glass sandwich is the more durable of the two common constructions, which is why it carries a 30-year power-output warranty rather than the usual 25.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nAt STC the module delivers 545 Wp at 41.9 V and 13.02 A, with an open-circuit voltage of 49.76 V and a short-circuit current of 13.9 A. Maximum system voltage is 1500 V and the maximum series fuse rating is 25 A. Temperature coefficients are −0.34 %/°C on power and −0.25 %/°C on Voc, with NOCT at 43 °C and an operating range of −40 °C to +85 °C. The laminate is rated for 5400 Pa of front load and 2400 Pa of rear load. The panel measures 2272 mm tall × 1133 mm wide × 35 mm deep and weighs 32.5 kg. The IP68 weatherproof PPO junction box carries three bypass diodes and 500 mm of 4 mm² cable ending in IP68 MC4-compatible connectors.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nIt bolts to the mounting structure through eight 14 × 9 mm holes in the frame; clamp mounting is permitted per Waaree's installation manual. Because it is bifacial, leave clearance behind the array and avoid dark or shaded backgrounds if you want the rear-side gain. At 32.5 kg and 2.27 m long it is a two-person lift. Check string length against the 1500 V system limit and the 49.76 V open-circuit voltage before wiring.\n\n## What's in the box\n\nOne 545 Wp module with pre-attached junction box, cables and MC4-compatible connectors. Mounting structure, clamps, earthing hardware and cable are not included. Warranty: 12 years on product and workmanship, 30 years on power output, with 82.05% of rated power guaranteed at year 30.",
